---
title: "Load the capture module before dispatching its effect"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: finished
    lg1: in progress
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 blue
  s0: Module loading
  s1: Capture handler registered
  s2: Window and unsupported error returned
  s3: Native capture dispatched
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: initialize the module
  s1 --> s2: return ENOTSUP and window
  s1 --> s3: run native capture
  class s0 blue
  class s1 blue
  class s2 teal
  class s3 teal
